LayoutGrid 47x3

Components:
  [0] input_pin "a" @(0,0) 5x3
  [1] not_gate "n1" @(10,0) 5x3
  [2] not_gate "n2" @(20,0) 5x3
  [3] not_gate "n3" @(30,0) 5x3
  [4] output_pin "out" @(40,0) 7x3

Wires:
  0.out -> 1.in: (5,1) -> (9,1)
  1.out -> 2.in: (15,1) -> (19,1)
  2.out -> 3.in: (25,1) -> (29,1)
  3.out -> 4.in: (35,1) -> (39,1)
